flowchart TD
    Start([Stage Execution Started])

    CallVendor[Call External Vendor]
    Success[Stage Successful]
    Fail[Vendor Failure Detected]

    ShortRetry["Service-Level Retry<br/>(short retry with backoff)"]
    LongRetry["Workflow-Level Retry<br/>(wait & retry)"]
    Exhausted[Retry Limit Exhausted]

    Reject([Loan Rejected])
    End([Stage Completed / Journey Continues])

    Start --> CallVendor

    CallVendor -->|Success| Success
    Success --> End

    CallVendor -->|Failure| Fail

    Fail --> ShortRetry
    ShortRetry -->|Success| Success
    ShortRetry -->|Failure| LongRetry

    LongRetry -->|Retry Available| CallVendor
    LongRetry -->|No Retry Left| Exhausted

    Exhausted --> Reject